openresty:latest</code> tag points to the latest <code class=3D"MuiTypograp=
hy-root MuiTypography-inline-code css-1r5tc1u">bookworm</code> image.</p>
<p class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-41w77t">Since <code =
class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inline-code css-1r5tc1u">1.19.3.2=
-1</code>, all flavors support multi-architecture builds, both <code class=
=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inline-code css-1r5tc1u">amd64</code> =
and <code class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inline-code css-1r5tc1u=
">aarch64</code>.  Since <code class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-in=
line-code css-1r5tc1u">1.21.4.1-1</code>, the <code class=3D"MuiTypography-=
root MuiTypography-inline-code css-1r5tc1u">s390x</code> architecture is su=
pported for build-from-source Ubuntu flavors (like <code class=3D"MuiTypogr=
aphy-root MuiTypography-inline-code css-1r5tc1u">jammy</code>); prior to ve=
rsion <code class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inline-code css-1r5tc=
1u">1.27.1.2-3</code>, <a class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit=
 MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways DDSExternalLink-root css-esgkec" rel=
=3D"nofollow noopener" href=3D"https://github.com/zherczeg/sljit/issues/89"=
