<p class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-41w77t">There are ar=
chitecture-specific tags as well, <code class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypo=
graphy-inline-code css-1r5tc1u">&lt;openresty-version&gt;-&lt;image-version=
&gt;-&lt;flavor&gt;-&lt;arch&gt;</code>, but one would generally pull from =
the multi-architecture name above.</p>
<p class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-41w77t">It is <em>hi=
ghly recommended</em> that you use the upstream-based images for best suppo=
rt.  For best stability, pin your images to the full tag, for example <code=
 class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inline-code css-1r5tc1u">1.21.4.=
1-0-bionic</code>.</p>
<p class=3D"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-41w77t"><code class=
